<title>FRANCE: Algerian doctors end strike in capital's hospitals.</title>
<headline>Algerian doctors end strike in capital's hospitals.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Algiers hospital doctors resumed duties on Monday after a two-day strike to back demands for more pay, the official Algerian news agency APS said.</p>
<p>Doctors and health ministry representatives were in talks on Monday but it was not clear whether they reached any accord.</p>
